                    CalmSet is a VR experience focused on relaxation and stress reduction. 
                    In this project I led software engineering efforts for VR application development, REST API design, and backend services that supported the experience.
                </p>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="badge bg-primary">VR</span>
                    <span class="badge bg-primary">C#</span>
                    <span class="badge bg-primary">REST API</span>
                    <span class="badge bg-primary">IIS</span>
                    <span class="badge bg-primary">SQL Server</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="project-image-placeholder rounded shadow-sm">
                    <img src="/images/calmsetProfile.jpg" alt="CalmSet experience" class="img-fluid rounded" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="project-section py-5">
    <div class="container">
