                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Project Type:</strong> VR application</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Core Focus:</strong> VR app development + REST services</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> IIS + SQL Server</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Location:</strong> Lublin, Poland</li>
                </ul>
