            <li class="mb-2">Designed and implemented REST APIs for the VR platform.</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Integrated backend services with the VR client.</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Configured and managed IIS for deployment.</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Designed and managed SQL databases and optimized queries.</li>
